SUMMARY:Afterwork English Networking #77
LOCATION:Venue to be announced
DESCRIPTION:Afterwork English Networking is where Paraguay meets the world\, in English. Every second Tuesday from 18:00\, English speakers in Asunción meet for a drink and a chat after work\, wherever they learnt their English. Locals come to meet people from abroad\, and newcomers come to meet locals. It’s a social evening in English\, not a class\, so come ready to talk. Half the room comes on their own\, so if y\nBy The Asunción Times\ntheconnectup.com/citybanana
