DESCRIPTION:Every Saturday morning the honour guard at the Panteón Nacional de los Héroes is relieved in a formal ceremony on the steps\, in full dress uniform\, right in the middle of the historic centre. This is a genuine piece of national ritual rather than something staged for visitors\, and there is not a word of Spanish to follow\, so it works for everyone. It costs nothing and there is nothing to book. The\ntheconnectup.com/citybanana
